            <title>[IGNITE-23444] class IgniteNodeSpecExcludeDucktests restricts usage of custom specs in duck tests</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-23444</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Class IgniteNodeSpecExcludeDucktests always inherits a default configurations, not the one that was used in actual test case, which prohibits the usage of custom specs in tests.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
